I've been starting to explore both on the pc limited version of 3.0f
and the full-up sun version, and have one question -- Why were the
three stooges removed?  was it a function/implementation of 2.3e only?
Were they the only ones removed? -- I haven't seen them, even though
I could only get to level 15 so far in discovery mode.

I do have to agree with some of the others, concerning the playing
of this game -- me being a recent new nethack'er.  New docs with
hints of the Gods/Implementors for those of us who don't know what
to do with alters, or what enabling/disabling some of the options
during the installation process does to our playing.

I will say this, I really enjoy playing this game and can't wait to
get the amiga port running on my system at home (want to hear all of
the sound effects -- hope they take advantage of the amiga's sound
generation capability).  An interesting diversion would be to 
add digitized sounds/voices ala vincent price's laughter from the
'thriller' sonix file that's been floating around.

